{"title": "Pyroquickness Hat", "pageid": 13431, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Pyroquickness_Hat", "categories": ["Bugs", "Helmets", "Very rare items", "Sources of Additional Bonus Actions", "Fire set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-veryrare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Pyroquickness_Hat_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Pyroquickness_Hat_Icon.png/300px-Pyroquickness_Hat_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/c/cc/Pyroquickness_Hat_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Pyroquickness Hat image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Pyroquickness_Hat_Icon.png/300px-Pyroquickness_Hat_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Pyroquickness_Hat_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Pyroquickness Hat</span></a> is a very rare <a href=\"/wiki/Headwear\" title=\"Headwear\">Hat</a> that burns the wearer when casting a <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span> spell, but also grants them an extra <a href=\"/wiki/Bonus_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Action\">Bonus Action</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Merely holding the circlet makes your skin flush, filling you with determination and righteous fury.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helmets\" title=\"Helmets\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/25px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/38px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/50px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Helmets\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/25px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helmets\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Helmets\">Helmets</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Very rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Very rare</span></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Journal Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Items_consumable_by_Gale\" title=\"List of Items consumable by Gale\">Consumable</a> by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/38px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/50px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gale\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 160 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  160  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Fire_BonusActionOnFireSpell_Circlet</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Fire_BonusActionOnFireSpell_Circlet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Fire_BonusActionOnFireSpell_Circlet\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">d5e4dce0-4385-4fae-a601-22a11fe0b2af</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:d5e4dce0-4385-4fae-a601-22a11fe0b2af\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:d5e4dce0-4385-4fae-a601-22a11fe0b2af\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Fire_BonusActionOnFireSpell_Circlet</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Fire_BonusActionOnFireSpell_Circlet+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Fire_BonusActionOnFireSpell_Circlet+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Fiery_Return\" title=\"Fiery Return\">Fiery Return</a></dt><dd>When you deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage with a levelled spell, you <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\">Burn</a> yourself and gain an additional <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> this round.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerous_Vault\" title=\"Sorcerous Vault\">Sorcerous Vault</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;411&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;997</span>: In an invisible chest in the vault of Elminster</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/See_Invisibility\" title=\"See Invisibility\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/See_Invisibility_Icon.webp/20px-See_Invisibility_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/See_Invisibility_Icon.webp/30px-See_Invisibility_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/See_Invisibility_Icon.webp/40px-See_Invisibility_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"See Invisibility\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/See_Invisibility_Icon.webp/20px-See_Invisibility_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/See_Invisibility_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/See_Invisibility\" title=\"See Invisibility\">See Invisibility</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Faerie_Fire\" title=\"Faerie Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp/20px-Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp/30px-Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp/40px-Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Faerie Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp/20px-Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Faerie_Fire_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Faerie_Fire\" title=\"Faerie Fire\">Faerie Fire</a> can be used to see the invisible chest.</li>\n<li>The <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Armour\" title=\"Helldusk Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Armour\" title=\"Helldusk Armour\">Helldusk Armour</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wet\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\">Wet</a> condition can negate the self-burning effect on the wearer while still allowing them to receive the extra bonus action.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Fiery Return:</i></p>\n<ul><li>The conditions for activating Fiery Return are to deal fire damage with a non-cantrip spell <em>or</em> a melee spell attack roll.\n<ul><li>Attacks with a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade\" title=\"Flame Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/30px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/40px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flame Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade\" title=\"Flame Blade\">Flame Blade</a> conjured by the druid spell count as melee spell attacks, so they trigger Fiery Return. However, this is not true of a Flame Blade summoned by a <a href=\"/wiki/Mephistopheles_tiefling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mephistopheles tiefling\">mephistopheles tiefling's</a> racial feature or a permanent Flame Blade acquired through the exploit described <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade#Bugs\" title=\"Flame Blade\">here</a>.</li>\n<li>The <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Daredevil_Gloves\" title=\"Daredevil Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/82/Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Daredevil_Gloves\" title=\"Daredevil Gloves\">Daredevil Gloves</a> can turn ranged spell attacks into melee spell attacks, so cantrips like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Bolt\" title=\"Fire Bolt\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp/20px-Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/23/Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp/30px-Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/23/Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp/40px-Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire Bolt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp/20px-Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/23/Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Bolt\" title=\"Fire Bolt\">Fire Bolt</a> <em>can</em> trigger Fiery Return when paired with the gloves.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Fiery Return:</i></p>\n<ul><li>If Fiery Return is triggered with a <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> (for example, with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Metamagic:_Quickened_Spell\" title=\"Metamagic: Quickened Spell\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp/20px-Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp/30px-Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp/40px-Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Metamagic: Quickened Spell\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp/20px-Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Metamagic:_Quickened_Spell\" title=\"Metamagic: Quickened Spell\">Metamagic: Quickened Spell</a>), the extra bonus action granted by this passive is wasted and consumed immediately.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellcrawler\" title=\"Hellcrawler\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Hellcrawler_Icon.webp/20px-Hellcrawler_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Hellcrawler_Icon.webp/30px-Hellcrawler_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Hellcrawler_Icon.webp/40px-Hellcrawler_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellcrawler\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Hellcrawler_Icon.webp/20px-Hellcrawler_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Hellcrawler_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellcrawler\" title=\"Hellcrawler\">Hellcrawler</a>, a class action granted by the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Boots\" title=\"Helldusk Boots\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/49/Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Boots\" title=\"Helldusk Boots\">Helldusk Boots</a>, triggers Fiery Return, essentially negating the bonus action cost.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Searing_Smite\" title=\"Searing Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/30px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Searing Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Searing_Smite\" title=\"Searing Smite\">Searing Smite</a> does not trigger Fiery Return.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 217.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 215.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Jane-katsubo-hats.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Concept art by Jane Katsubo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Jane-katsubo-hats.jpg/323px-Jane-katsubo-hats.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Jane-katsubo-hats.jpg/485px-Jane-katsubo-hats.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Jane-katsubo-hats.jpg/646px-Jane-katsubo-hats.jpg.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Concept art by Jane Katsubo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Jane-katsubo-hats.jpg/323px-Jane-katsubo-hats.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Jane-katsubo-hats.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Concept art by Jane Katsubo</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200015\nCache expiry: 86400\nRed